# 11. Model Serializer + Validation gs5

#   - it will automatically create fields based on the model
#   - it will automatically create create() and update() methods
#   - it will automatically create validators based on the model field validators


#   - validations are some in both case of serializer and model serializer but in model serializer we can also use model field validators which is not possible in serializer class

