# 25. THROTTLING | 12: generate ID based on user IP

    # - ScopedRateThrottle : it is used to limit the number of requests that can be made by a user in a specific time period.
    # - UserRateThrottle : it is used to limit the number of requests that can be made by a user in a specific time period.
    # - AnonRateThrottle : it is used to limit the number of requests that can be made by a user in a specific time period.
    # - SimpleRateThrottle : it is used to limit the number of requests that can be made by a user in a specific time period.

    # You can define in Gloobal

